          "id": "headline",
          "type": "heading",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 1,
          "props": {
            "text": "Config drift is a runtime bug. Stop shipping it.",
            "level": 1,
            "size": "52px",
            "weight": 600
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "subtitle",
          "type": "text",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 2,
          "props": {
            "text": "Your staging YAML diverged from prod three sprints ago. Service A reads SECRET_KEY, Service B reads SECRET, and the new hire just deployed with an empty string. ConfigMesh replaces this mess with typed schemas, runtime validation, and hot-reload across every service in your fleet — from a single source of truth that fails fast at boot, not at 3 AM."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "primaryCta",
          "type": "button",
